* tcam_cells.lib -- GENERATED by circuit/tcam/tcam_build.py (do not edit by hand).
* 2-FeFET TCAM cell (Ni et al., Nat. Electron. 2019) and simple periphery, VDD = 1.0 V.
* Needs device/ngspice/fefet_preisach.lib and models/mosfet/standin45_bsim4.lib.
*
* tcam2f: FeFET-L gate SL, FeFET-R gate SLB, drains on ML, sources on ScL, bodies on PW.
* dvgl/dvgr: gate-referred V_th shifts (Monte Carlo); xl*/xr*: domain start states.
.subckt tcam2f sl slb ml scl pw params: dvgl=0 dvgr=0 xl1=0 xl2=0 xl3=0 xl4=0 xl5=0 xl6=0 xl7=0 xl8=0
+ xl9=0 xl10=0 xl11=0 xl12=0 xl13=0 xl14=0 xl15=0 xl16=0
+ xr1=0 xr2=0 xr3=0 xr4=0 xr5=0 xr6=0 xr7=0 xr8=0
+ xr9=0 xr10=0 xr11=0 xr12=0 xr13=0 xr14=0 xr15=0 xr16=0
XL sl ml scl pw fefet_c16 dvg={dvgl} x0_1={xl1} x0_2={xl2} x0_3={xl3} x0_4={xl4} x0_5={xl5} x0_6={xl6} x0_7={xl7} x0_8={xl8}
+ x0_9={xl9} x0_10={xl10} x0_11={xl11} x0_12={xl12} x0_13={xl13} x0_14={xl14} x0_15={xl15} x0_16={xl16}
XR slb ml scl pw fefet_c16 dvg={dvgr} x0_1={xr1} x0_2={xr2} x0_3={xr3} x0_4={xr4} x0_5={xr5} x0_6={xr6} x0_7={xr7} x0_8={xr8}
+ x0_9={xr9} x0_10={xr10} x0_11={xr11} x0_12={xr12} x0_13={xr13} x0_14={xr14} x0_15={xr15} x0_16={xr16}
.ends tcam2f

* tcam2f_frozen: the same cell with frozen-domain FeFETs (nanosecond searches only; start
* every FeFET from a saved state with .ic on its node m). Checked against tcam2f in test 3b.
.subckt tcam2f_frozen sl slb ml scl pw params: dvgl=0 dvgr=0
XL sl ml scl pw fefet_c16_frozen dvg={dvgl}
XR slb ml scl pw fefet_c16_frozen dvg={dvgr}
.ends tcam2f_frozen

* mlpre: match-line precharge pMOS from vdd, gate preb (low = precharge).
.subckt mlpre ml preb vdd
Mp ml preb vdd vdd pmos45 w=200n l=45n as=18f ad=18f ps=560n pd=560n
.ends mlpre

* mlsa: sense amplifier = two inverters. miss goes high when ML falls below the first
* inverter's trip point (about 0.45 V); match is its complement. 1 fF load on each output.
.subckt mlsa ml miss match vdd
Mp1 miss ml vdd vdd pmos45 w=240n l=45n as=22f ad=22f ps=660n pd=660n
Mn1 miss ml 0 0 nmos45 w=120n l=45n as=11f ad=11f ps=420n pd=420n
Mp2 match miss vdd vdd pmos45 w=240n l=45n as=22f ad=22f ps=660n pd=660n
Mn2 match miss 0 0 nmos45 w=120n l=45n as=11f ad=11f ps=420n pd=420n
Cl1 miss 0 1e-15
Cl2 match 0 1e-15
.ends mlsa

* sldrv: search-line driver, CMOS inverter on the search supply vs (out = not in).
.subckt sldrv in out vs
Mp out in vs vs pmos45 w=360n l=45n as=32f ad=32f ps=900n pd=900n
Mn out in 0 0 nmos45 w=180n l=45n as=16f ad=16f ps=540n pd=540n
.ends sldrv
